  "body": "This finite research result extends PR949's contracted PR922/924 factory gauge class to a just-in-time persistent coefficient-work policy. Complete independent cost censuses cover all39,424 magnitude placements in each of four orientations, with an exact eightfold sign quotient.\n\nMinima per real component are46,46,48,48 for forward/inverse/inverse-transpose/transpose. The strong boundary-clear-only comparator is48 in every orientation, so cache reuse saves2 only forward/inverse and does not improve the maximum48. Earlier clear-elision savings are reported separately. The original PR924 gauge already attains the minima; no new gauge priority or kappa is claimed.\n\nReproduce: `python -I -O -B research/factory-persistent-work-seed23/verify.py`.\n\nExpected: `PASS_FACTORY_PERSISTENT_WORK placements=39424x4 minima=46,46,48,48 controls=11 no_new_kappa`.\n\nThe verifier checks exact source inventory/hashes, complete histogram equality against a separate version-label oracle, the credited PR949 histogram, and144 winning mode/sign/placement streams on all nine arbitrary data/work input columns. The unchanged PR696 emitter confirms paid overwrite-COPY semantics. Local prefix peaks/depths match, eleven controls pass, and the whole certificate is compared canonically. Native, whole-provider physical/frame/precision admission and global invoices are not claimed.\n\nCredits PR949/Ross Richardson, PR922/924/CubeJerry, PR696/Sagar Thakrar and the retained historical lineage; known-zero clear and coefficient sharing predecessors are identified separately. Prepared for @woklerx with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance, Apache-2.0. Only research/factory-persistent-work-seed23/ is added.\n",
